,"textMapHash":635238162,"text":"催眠術か…そういえば、君たちは猫を連れてきているんだな。賢そうな子だ。","nextNodeIds":[741850114,741850116]},{"nodeId":741850114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":801473746,"text":"うん、賢いよ。","nextNodeIds":[741850115]},{"nodeId":741850115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1508842874,"text":"こいつはオイラたちの仲間だぞ。まあ、こっから先の旅に連れて行くわけにもいかないけど…","nextNodeIds":[741850118]},{"nodeId":741850118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"エスト","textMapHash":2405294978,"text":"ならちょうどいい。クラブには猫ハウスがある。催眠術を研究してたやつが猫を連れて旅に出た後、ずっと空いてるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[741850119]},{"nodeId":741850119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"エスト","textMapHash":4039893338,"text":"もしよかったら、その子をここに預けて行ってくれ。","nextNodeIds":[741850120]},{"nodeId":741850120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"エスト","textMapHash":1934260266,"text":"どうしてかは分からないけど、僕たちには特別な縁があるみたいだ。ちゃんと世話するよ。","nextNodeIds":[741850121]},{"nodeId":741850121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5326,"speakerName":"エスト","textMapHash":1247706946,"text":"猫ハウスは建物の向こうにある。行けば分かるさ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":741850116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3131261594,"text":"この子は仲間だよ。","nextNodeIds":[741850117]},{"nodeId":741850117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2096246954,"text":"そうだけど、旅に連れて行くわけにもいかないよ…","nextNodeIds":[741850118]},{"nodeId":741850109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3234459922,"text":"そこは重要じゃない。","nextNodeIds":[741850110]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7418501,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_